      "description": "Add This Code : \n\n```csharp\nbuilder.Services.AddAuthorizationBuilder();\n```\n\n\n--- \n🎯 Purpose\n\nRegisters the authorization services in the dependency injection container and returns a builder for configuring authorization policies.\n\n📦 What It Does\nBehind the scenes:\n- ✅ Registers IAuthorizationService (used for checking authorization)\n- ✅ Registers IAuthorizationPolicyProvider (manages policies)\n- ✅ Registers IAuthorizationHandlerProvider (finds authorization handlers)\n- ✅ Returns AuthorizationBuilder for fluent configuration\n",
