      "description": "Purpuse : \n- What it is: Inline claim-based authorization for the endpoint.\n- What it requires: An authenticated user whose JWT contains claim scope with value basket.read.\n\nBehavior:\n- Missing/invalid token → 401 Unauthorized\n- Valid token without scope=basket.read → 403 Forbidden\n- Valid token with scope=basket.read → Endpoint runs",
