      "title": "Testing ",
      "description": "Test with the user token to get the basket data . \n\n\nNext Generate a GUID to represent an user Id different than the basket User Id . \n\n>> [guid]::NewGuid()\n\nGenerate an access Token with this GUID : \n\n>> dotnet user-jwts create --scope gamestore_api.all --name ´new-generate-guid´\n\n> Note : --name is sub\n\n\nTest in postman with the new token to acess an other user basket you should see 403 Forbiden \n\nThen test with an admin role :\n\n>> dotnet user-jwts create --scope gamestore_api.all --name ´new-generate-guid´ --role Admin\n\nyou should see 200 ok "
    },
